  {
   "kind": 2,
   "value": "(* L1 is spanned by the three controls Om1, Om1 T11one, Om1 T21one: expand Om1 rho(1/z) in them (exact), at both twist points *)\nexpandRho[zz_, ww_] := Module[{om = oneSiteVac[zz, ww], bas, sol},\n  bas = {om, om . T11one[zz], om . T21one[zz]};\n  sol = Quiet[LinearSolve[Transpose[bas], om . ρdiag[1/zz]]];\n  {sol, Transpose[bas] . sol === om . ρdiag[1/zz]}];\nGrid[{{\"P1: coefficients of Om1 rho(1/z) on {Om1, Om1 T11one, Om1 T21one}, exact?\", ToString[expandRho[zP1, wP1]]}, {\"P1'\", ToString[expandRho[zP1c, wP1c]]}}, Frame -> All, Alignment -> Left]",
   "languageId": "wolfram",
   "outputs": [],
   "metadata": {}
  },
  {
