   "value": "## Task 3 (not run)\n\nSkipped by the spec's own stop rule: l1 = 3 < 8 and neither (a) nor (d) lies in L1 (not at D2, not at D3 either), so there is no polynomial-torus family to untwist. The regime question for the sum of two products is left to the main session.",
