  {
   "kind": 1,
   "value": "## Task 5. Rational Q-numbers P/Q: solve Phi_v . Q = <Om x Om|P for (P, Q) in D_a x D_b (exact)",
   "languageId": "markdown",
   "outputs": [],
   "metadata": {}
