   "value": "**Exploratory scan result (cell 47, 6 s, P1 and P1' identical).** Entries {dim (D2,D1), dim (D2,D2)}; (D2,D1) is 0 for all of them.\n\n- Solve in (D2,D2): Om_{(w1,3)} (x) Om_{(w1,2)}: 4; Om_{(w1,3)} (x) Om_{(w1,y*)}: 4; Om_{(w1,3)} (x) Om_w: 6; Om_w (x) Om_{(w1,3)}: 5. That is, products of two vacua of common w1 with independent y's on both sites are (2,2)-rational Q-numbers.\n- Do NOT solve (0): every target containing the torus factor rho(1/(w'-z)) or rho(1/z) on a y-deformed vacuum, in any combination tried: Om_{(w1,3)} rho(1/(3/y0-z)) (x) Om_{(w1,y*)} and (x) Om_{(w1,3)}; Om_{(w1,y*)} rho(1/(w2-z)) (x) Om_{(w1,3)} and (x) Om_w; Om_{(w1,y*)} (x) Om_{(w1,y*)} rho(1/(w2-z)); Om_w rho(1/z) (x) Om_{(w1,3)}; Om_{(w1,3)} rho(1/z) (x) Om_w.",
