   "value": "## Task 10. Torus content of the localising span (exact)",
   "languageId": "markdown",
   "outputs": [],
   "metadata": {}
  },
  {
   "kind": 2,
   "value": "(* (i) one-site operators T11^(1), T21^(1) at theta1-2h at symbolic z: diagonality, eigenvalues per weight, candidates *)\nzsy = {zA, zB, zC}; T11s = T11one[zsy]; T21s = T21one[zsy];\noffd[m_] := Union[Flatten[Simplify[m - DiagonalMatrix[Diagonal[m]]]]];\nblk = T11s[[{4, 5}, {4, 5}]];\nmuL = wt1;\ncands = <|\"e1(1/z) = sum mu_k/z_k\" -> Function[mu, Sum[mu[[k]]/zsy[[k]], {k, 3}]], \"rho(1/z) e1(z)\" -> Function[mu, Product[zsy[[k]]^-mu[[k]], {k, 3}] Sum[mu[[k]] zsy[[k]], {k, 3}]], \"e2 of {z_k x mu_k}\" -> Function[mu, With[{ms = Flatten[Table[ConstantArray[zsy[[k]], mu[[k]]], {k, 3}]]}, Total[Times @@@ Subsets[ms, {2}]]]], \"e2 of {z_k x (2-mu_k)}\" -> Function[mu, With[{ms = Flatten[Table[ConstantArray[zsy[[k]], 2 - mu[[k]]], {k, 3}]]}, Total[Times @@@ Subsets[ms, {2}]]]], \"e1 of {z_k x (2-mu_k)}\" -> Function[mu, Total[Flatten[Table[ConstantArray[zsy[[k]], 2 - mu[[k]]], {k, 3}]]]]|>;\none = {1, 2, 3, 5, 6, 7, 8};\n(* the six one-dimensional weights are states 1,2,3,6,7,8 *)\nonedim = {1, 2, 3, 6, 7, 8};\nratioConst[cf_] := Module[{rs = Table[Simplify[Diagonal[T11s][[i]]/cf[muL[[i]]]], {i, onedim}]}, {Length[Union[rs]] == 1, rs[[1]]}];\ncandRes = Table[c -> Quiet[Check[ratioConst[cands[c]], \"undefined\"]], {c, Keys[cands]}];\nt21ok = And @@ Table[Simplify[T21s[[i, i]] + 3/8 Product[zsy[[k]]^(2 - muL[[i]][[k]]), {k, 3}]] === 0, {i, 8}];\n(* numeric eigenvalue check at rational z *)\neig11 = Eigenvalues[T11s /. Thread[zsy -> zP1]];\nGrid[{{\"T21 off-diagonal entries\", ToString[offd[T21s]]}, {\"T21 = -(3/8) prod z_k^(2-mu_k) on every weight (= -3h^3 chi3^2 prod z^-mu)\", t21ok}, {\"T11 off-diagonal entries (nonzero only inside the weight (1,1,1) block, states 4,5)\", ToString[offd[T11s]]}, {\"T11 diagonal on the six 1-dim weights (states 1,2,3,6,7,8)\", ToString[Factor /@ Diagonal[T11s][[onedim]]]}, {\"weights of those states\", ToString[muL[[onedim]]]}, {\"T11 on (1,1,1): block\", ToString[blk]}, {\"trace, det of the block\", ToString[{Factor[Tr[blk]], Factor[Det[blk]]}]}, {\"eigenvalues of the block\", ToString[Factor /@ Eigenvalues[blk]]}, {\"block scalar? (it is not diagonal)\", offd[blk] === {0}}, {\"candidate test: T11 eigenvalue/candidate constant over the six 1-dim weights?\", ToString[candRes]}, {\"T11 eigenvalues at P1 z\", ToString[N[eig11, 8]]}}, Frame -> All, Alignment -> Left]",
   "languageId": "wolfram",
   "outputs": [],
   "metadata": {}
  },
  {
   "kind": 1,
   "value": "**Task 10 (i) result (cell 55; symbolic z).**\n\n- T21^(1) is diagonal in the GT weight basis (off-diagonal entries 0) with eigenvalue **-(3/8) prod_k z_k^(2-mu_k) = -3 h^3 chi3^2 prod z^-mu** on every weight (check True), as expected.\n- T11^(1) is NOT diagonal: off-diagonal entries are zero except inside the weight-(1,1,1) block (states 4,5), where they are (zA-zB)zC/8 and 3(zA-zB)zC/8. On the six 1-dim weights it is diagonal with eigenvalue (3/4) chi3/z_m, m = the index with mu_m = 2: (2,1,0),(2,0,1): (3/4) zB zC; (1,2,0),(0,2,1): (3/4) zA zC; (1,0,2),(0,1,2): (3/4) zA zB.\n- On (1,1,1) the block is [[3(zA+zB)zC/8, 3(zA-zB)zC/8],[(zA-zB)zC/8, zA zB/2 + (zA+zB)zC/8]]: trace e2(z)/2, det (3/16) e3 e1; eigenvalues (e2 -/+ sqrt(e2^2 - 3 e1 e3))/4: irrational and not scalar. At P1 z: eigenvalues 1.40625 (x2), 1.16937, 0.75 (x2), 0.68480, 0.625 (x2).\n- Candidate comparison: for each of e1(1/z) = sum mu_k/z_k, rho(1/z) e1(z), e2 of {z_k x mu_k}, e2 and e1 of {z_k x (2-mu_k)}, the ratio T11-eigenvalue/candidate over the six 1-dim weights is NOT a constant (all False). **T11^(1) is none of them, and is not a torus element** (it is not even diagonal; a torus must be scalar on (1,1,1)).",
   "languageId": "markdown",
   "outputs": [],
   "metadata": {}
  },
  {
   "kind": 2,
   "value": "(* (ii) torus lines in span{Om1, Om1 T11, Om1 T21}: om.(c0 + k1 T11 + k2 T21) = om.rho(d), unknown (c0,k1,k2,dA,dB), dC free (overall scale) *)\ntorusSolve[zz_, ww_] := Module[{om = oneSiteVac[zz, ww], T11n = T11one[zz], T21n = T21one[zz], eqs, sol},\n  eqs = om . (cc0 IdentityMatrix[8] + kk1 T11n + kk2 T21n) - om . ρdiag[{dA, dB, dC}];\n  sol = TimeConstrained[Solve[eqs == 0, {cc0, kk1, kk2, dA, dB}], 150, $Failed]; {sol, N[1/zz, 6]}];\nts1 = torusSolve[zP1, wP1]; ts1c = torusSolve[zP1c, wP1c];\n(* (iii) effective undone covector of the 5-dim span at theta1-2h. Correct form of the second rotation: omega2 = Om1 rho(exp(gamma (E23 - a E13))) with a = (w1-z1)/(w1-z2), gamma = -r3(w2) (the E23 line is conjugated by the Gauss factor of Om1: n^-1 e23 n = e23 - a e13); the exp(gamma E23) of the first draft of the spec is false (checked). Since exp(gamma N) is upper unitriangular, (h x h) fixes the HW kets and <v' x Om1 h|HW> = <v' h^-1 x Om1|HW>, so vt = v + v' rho(exp(-gamma N)). *)\nsopForm[zz_, ww_] := Module[{om = oneSiteVac[zz, ww], w1 = ww[[1]], w2 = ww[[2]], om2, gam, aa, Nn, tc = tZexact[zz], v0 = thN[[1]] - 2 hN, Om2, ops, dec, vX, vpX, vt, resid, eqs, sol, gE},\n  om2 = oneSiteVac[zz, {w1, zz[[2]], 1}];\n  gam = -(((w1 - zz[[2]]) (-w2 + zz[[2]]) (zz[[1]] - zz[[3]]))/((zz[[1]] - zz[[2]]) (w1 - zz[[3]]) (-w2 + zz[[3]])));\n  aa = (w1 - zz[[1]])/(w1 - zz[[2]]); Nn = Ee[2, 3] - aa Ee[1, 3];\n  gE = {om . expN[gam Nn] === om2, om . expN[gam Ee[2, 3]] === om2};\n  Om2 = Flatten[KroneckerProduct[om, om]];\n  ops = {id2, Tfused[tc][{1, 0}, v0], Tfused[tc][{1, 1}, v0], Tfused[tc][{2, 0}, v0], Tfused[tc][{2, 1}, v0]};\n  dec = Table[With[{Ph = Partition[Om2 . Normal[X], d1]}, Table[LinearSolve[Transpose[{om, om2}], Ph[[i]]], {i, d1}]], {X, ops}];\n  resid = And @@ Flatten[Table[Transpose[{om, om2}] . dec[[k, i]] === Partition[Om2 . Normal[ops[[k]]], d1][[i]], {k, 5}, {i, d1}]];\n  vX = dec[[All, All, 1]]; vpX = dec[[All, All, 2]];\n  vt = Table[vX[[k]] + vpX[[k]] . expN[-gam Nn], {k, 5}];\n  eqs = Sum[cs[[k]] vt[[k]], {k, 5}] - om . ρdiag[{dA, dB, dC}];\n  sol = TimeConstrained[Solve[eqs == 0, {cs[[1]], cs[[2]], cs[[3]], cs[[4]], cs[[5]], dA, dB}], 200, $Failed];\n  <|\"gamma\" -> gam, \"a\" -> aa, \"omega2 = Om1 expN[gamma (E23 - a E13)], and with plain E23\" -> gE, \"decomposition exact\" -> resid, \"rank of the 5 effective vectors vt\" -> MatrixRank[vt], \"vp nonzero for\" -> Flatten@Position[vpX, _?(# =!= ConstantArray[0, d1] &), {1}, Heads -> False], \"solutions (c0..c4,dA,dB with dC free)\" -> sol, \"1/z\" -> 1/zz|>];\ncs = Array[cc, 5];\nsf1 = sopForm[zP1, wP1]; sf1c = sopForm[zP1c, wP1c];\nGrid[{{\"(ii) P1: solution set (cc0,kk1,kk2,dA,dB; dC free)\", ToString[ts1[[1]]]}, {\"1/z at P1 (d up to scale)\", ToString[ts1[[2]]]}, {\"(ii) P1'\", ToString[ts1c[[1]]]}, {\"1/z at P1'\", ToString[ts1c[[2]]]}, {\"(iii) P1 gamma, a\", ToString[{sf1[\"gamma\"], sf1[\"a\"]}]}, {\"omega2 = Om1 exp(gamma(E23 - a E13)) ; with plain E23\", ToString[sf1[\"omega2 = Om1 expN[gamma (E23 - a E13)], and with plain E23\"]]}, {\"decomposition exact\", sf1[\"decomposition exact\"]}, {\"rank of the 5 effective vectors\", sf1[\"rank of the 5 effective vectors vt\"]}, {\"operators with v' nonzero (1,T10,T11,T20,T21)\", ToString[sf1[\"vp nonzero for\"]]}, {\"(iii) P1 solutions\", ToString[sf1[\"solutions (c0..c4,dA,dB with dC free)\"]]}, {\"1/z\", ToString[sf1[\"1/z\"]]}, {\"(iii) P1' gamma, a, same checks\", ToString[{sf1c[\"gamma\"], sf1c[\"a\"], sf1c[\"omega2 = Om1 expN[gamma (E23 - a E13)], and with plain E23\"], sf1c[\"decomposition exact\"], sf1c[\"rank of the 5 effective vectors vt\"]}]}, {\"(iii) P1' solutions\", ToString[sf1c[\"solutions (c0..c4,dA,dB with dC free)\"]]}}, Frame -> All, Alignment -> Left]",
   "languageId": "wolfram",
   "outputs": [],
   "metadata": {}
  },
  {
   "kind": 1,
   "value": "**Task 10 (ii),(iii) result (cell 57; P1 and P1').**\n\n- (ii) Exact solve of Om1 (cc0 + kk1 T11 + kk2 T21) = Om1 rho(d), unknowns (cc0,kk1,kk2,dA,dB), dC free: exactly three solution branches, at both points: the zero solution; kk1 = 0, cc0 = 0, kk2 != 0, d proportional to **1/z** ((4/9, 8/15, 1) = 1/z up to scale at P1; (2/7, 12/35, 1) at P1'), kk2 = -(1024/2025) dC^3 at P1; and cc0 = dC^3, kk1 = kk2 = 0, d = (1,1,1). **No nontrivial torus line, and T11 never enters.**\n- (iii) The first-draft statement omega2 = Om1 rho(exp(gamma E23)) is false (checked: False for gamma = -65/44, +65/44 and for the solution of the equation; no gamma exists). The correct exact form, because Om1 = e1 rho(n) and conjugation by the Gauss factor n gives n^-1 e23 n = e23 - a e13: **omega2 = Om1 rho(exp(gamma (E23 - a E13)))** with a = (w1-z1)/(w1-z2) and gamma = -r3(w2) = -(w1-z2)(z2-w2)(z1-z3)/((z1-z2)(w1-z3)(z3-w2)); verified exactly: gamma = -65/44, a = 4/5 at P1; gamma = -3465/1073, a = 1/2 at P1'. The undone effective site-1 covector is vt(c) = v(c) + v'(c) rho(exp(-gamma (E23 - a E13))) (justified since exp(gamma N) is upper unitriangular and (h x h) fixes the HW kets). The decomposition <Om Om|X = v (x) Om1 + v' (x) omega2 is exact for the five operators {1, T10, T11, T20, T21}(theta1-2h); v' is nonzero only for T10 and T20; the five effective vectors vt are linearly independent (rank 5); the exact solve vt(c) = Om1 rho(d) again gives only the three branches: zero, c = (0,0,0,0,c5) with d proportional to 1/z (c5 = 14049280 dC^3/2539107 at P1), and c = (c1,0,0,0,0) with d = 1. **No torus line is created by T10, T20.**",
   "languageId": "markdown",
   "outputs": [],
   "metadata": {}
  },
  {
   "kind": 2,
   "value": "(* (iv) the enlarged 8-dim linear family of Two-rotations-det-overlap sec 5.3: {1, T10, T11, T20, T21 at th1-2h, t2(th1), t2(th2+h), t2(th2+h) t1(th2-h)}: site-2 column space of <Om Om|X *)\nrotTest[u_] := Module[{uu = u, s, a, b, c, sol},\n  sol = TimeConstrained[Solve[Thread[uu == s UnitVector[d1, 1] . expN[a Ee[1, 2]] . expN[b Ee[1, 3]] . expN[c Ee[2, 3]]], {s, a, b, c}], 60, $Failed];\n  If[sol === $Failed, \"timeout\", sol =!= {}]];\ncolSpace8[zz_, ww_] := Module[{tc = tZexact[zz], om = oneSiteVac[zz, ww], w1 = ww[[1]], om2, v0 = thN[[1]] - 2 hN, Om2, ops, names, Phs, S2, spanE, rowsOf, info},\n  om2 = oneSiteVac[zz, {w1, zz[[2]], 1}]; Om2 = Flatten[KroneckerProduct[om, om]];\n  ops = {id2, Tfused[tc][{1, 0}, v0], Tfused[tc][{1, 1}, v0], Tfused[tc][{2, 0}, v0], Tfused[tc][{2, 1}, v0], tEval[tc, 2, thN[[1]]], tEval[tc, 2, thN[[2]] + hN], tEval[tc, 2, thN[[2]] + hN] . tEval[tc, 1, thN[[2]] - hN]};\n  names = {\"1\", \"T10\", \"T11\", \"T20\", \"T21\", \"t2(th1)\", \"t2(th2+h)\", \"t2(th2+h)t1(th2-h)\"};\n  Phs = Table[Partition[Om2 . Normal[X], d1], {X, ops}];\n  rowsOf[m_] := DeleteCases[RowReduce[m], {0 ..}];\n  S2 = rowsOf[Join @@ Phs]; spanE = {om, om2};\n  info = Table[With[{R = rowsOf[Phs[[k]]]}, {names[[k]], Length[R], If[R === {}, 0, MatrixRank[Join[R, spanE]] - 2], Select[R, MatrixRank[Append[spanE, #]] == 3 &] // Length}], {k, 8}];\n  <|\"site-2 column space dimension\" -> Length[S2], \"Om1, om2 in it\" -> {MatrixRank[Append[S2, om]] == Length[S2], MatrixRank[Append[S2, om2]] == Length[S2]}, \"new directions beyond span{Om1,om2}\" -> Length[S2] - 2, \"per operator {name, rank Phi_X, dim of its site-2 rows modulo the E23 line (0 = inside the line), # basis rows outside the line}\" -> info, \"S2\" -> S2, \"spanE\" -> spanE|>];\n{tC8, c8P1} = AbsoluteTiming[colSpace8[zP1, wP1]];\nc8P1c = colSpace8[zP1c, wP1c];\n(* the new directions: reduce S2 modulo the E23 line and test the reduced basis vectors and each operator's outside rows for being rotations *)\nnewDirs[c_] := Module[{S2 = c[\"S2\"], E = c[\"spanE\"], full},\n  full = RowReduce[Join[E, S2]]; DeleteCases[RowReduce[Join[E, S2]], {0 ..}];\n  (* basis of S2 completing E *)\n  Select[S2, MatrixRank[Append[E, #]] == 3 &]];\nrotNew1 = With[{nd = newDirs[c8P1]}, {Length[nd], rotTest /@ nd}];\nGrid[{{\"time (s)\", tC8}, {\"P1: column space dim, Om1/om2 inside, new directions\", ToString[{c8P1[\"site-2 column space dimension\"], c8P1[\"Om1, om2 in it\"], c8P1[\"new directions beyond span{Om1,om2}\"]}]}, {\"per operator (name, rank, dim mod line, # rows outside)\", ToString[c8P1[\"per operator {name, rank Phi_X, dim of its site-2 rows modulo the E23 line (0 = inside the line), # basis rows outside the line}\"]]}, {\"P1': column space dim, Om1/om2 inside, new directions\", ToString[{c8P1c[\"site-2 column space dimension\"], c8P1c[\"Om1, om2 in it\"], c8P1c[\"new directions beyond span{Om1,om2}\"]}]}, {\"P1' per operator\", ToString[c8P1c[\"per operator {name, rank Phi_X, dim of its site-2 rows modulo the E23 line (0 = inside the line), # basis rows outside the line}\"]]}, {\"rotation test of the basis rows of S2 outside the E23 line (P1): count, flags\", ToString[rotNew1]}}, Frame -> All, Alignment -> Left]",
   "languageId": "wolfram",
   "outputs": [],
   "metadata": {}
  },
  {
   "kind": 2,
   "value": "(* rotation test of the site-2 directions brought in by the three new operators: row basis of Phi_X for t2(th1) (rank 2), t2(th2+h) and t2(th2+h)t1(th2-h) (rank 1 each); also the pairwise ranks of those directions together with Om1, om2 *)\nnewOps[zz_, ww_] := Module[{tc = tZexact[zz], om = oneSiteVac[zz, ww], w1 = ww[[1]], om2, Om2, ops, rowsOf, Rs},\n  om2 = oneSiteVac[zz, {w1, zz[[2]], 1}]; Om2 = Flatten[KroneckerProduct[om, om]];\n  ops = {tEval[tc, 2, thN[[1]]], tEval[tc, 2, thN[[2]] + hN], tEval[tc, 2, thN[[2]] + hN] . tEval[tc, 1, thN[[2]] - hN]};\n  rowsOf[m_] := DeleteCases[RowReduce[m], {0 ..}];\n  Rs = Table[rowsOf[Partition[Om2 . Normal[X], d1]], {X, ops}];\n  <|\"rows per op\" -> (Length /@ Rs), \"rotation flags of the row bases (t2(th1), t2(th2+h), B2)\" -> Map[rotTest, Rs, {2}], \"rank of all directions together with Om1, om2\" -> MatrixRank[Join[{om, om2}, Flatten[Rs, 1]]], \"rank of t2(th2+h) and B2 directions with Om1, om2\" -> MatrixRank[Join[{om, om2}, Rs[[2]], Rs[[3]]]], \"rank of t2(th1) rows with Om1, om2\" -> MatrixRank[Join[{om, om2}, Rs[[1]]]], \"are t2(th2+h) and B2 directions proportional\" -> (MatrixRank[Join[Rs[[2]], Rs[[3]]]] == 1)|>];\n{tNO, no1} = AbsoluteTiming[newOps[zP1, wP1]]; no1c = newOps[zP1c, wP1c];\nGrid[{{\"time (s)\", tNO}, {\"P1\", ToString[Normal[no1]]}, {\"P1'\", ToString[Normal[no1c]]}}, Frame -> All, Alignment -> Left]",
   "languageId": "wolfram",
   "outputs": [],
   "metadata": {}
