  {
   "kind": 1,
   "value": "## Task 11 (not run)\n\nConditional on a free-parameter torus in Task 9 or 10; there is none: (D3,1) and (D3,D1) solve only the controls; the exact torus solves in (ii) and (iii) have only the branches {0, d = 1, d = 1/z}. Stopped after Task 10 as specified.",
